        "en": "Trochę ciemne masz to mieszkanie"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Mami helps Angela *spakować się* (pack). Angela has not many *rzeczy* (things), and she needs *pobyć sama*, to be on her own for a while, *w ciszy*. Her flat is dark and cold: the windows are *od podwórka* (onto the courtyard), so there is *mało słońca*. Then she rings for a taxi: *chciałabym zamówić taksówkę*, and it will come *za dziesięć minut*."
      }
    }
  ],
